  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p>A point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> moves so that the sum of squares of its distances from the points <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>14</mn></math>.&nbsp;</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>17</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>C</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>17</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>D</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>17</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Area formed by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></math>&nbsp;will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>17</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>17</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>17</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>17</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>17</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>17</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msqrt><mn>17</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>17</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;sq units.</p></blockquote>",
